  "$comment": [
    "Exported by figma/export-effect-styles.js. Effect styles are a third Figma",
    "API \u2014 neither the variable export nor the text-style export covers them.",
    "",
    "They are NOT variable-bound in this file, so they cannot become tokens:",
    "there is nothing to alias. dist/css/elevation.css is generated from this",
    "data instead, which is what keeps a shadow from drifting out of the design.",
    "",
    "Colours are 0-255 channels plus alpha, exactly as Figma stores them."
